use.p:
As , but the colour used is the palette entry farthest
from the colour requested, as returned by ,
and a solid colour is always set.

The new control bits are calculated as (old AND R1) EOR R0, using only bits 0 to 3 of each register. The option held
in bits 16 to 18 is not affected. To set bits, put the bits in R0 and clear them in R1;
to clear bits, clear them in R1 and use zero in R0; to toggle bits, put the bits in R0 and set every bit of R1.
